==Description== 

The [[Image:FCGear_PlanetaryGear.svg|24px]] '''FCGear PlanetaryGear''' command calculates and creates a planetary gear assembly. A live preview helps to find valid settings.

[[Image:FCGear_PlanetaryGear_01.png|300px]] [[Image:Button_right.svg|16px|link=]] [[Image:FCGear_PlanetaryGear_02.png|300px]]

{{Caption|Live preview in the 3D View → Finished planetary gear assembly (colors added for clarity)}}

==Usage==

# There are several ways to invoke the command:
#* Press the {{Button|[[File:FCGear_PlanetaryGear.svg|16px]] [[FCGear_PlanetaryGear|Planetary Gear Assembly]]}} button in the toolbar.
#* Select the {{MenuCommand|Gear → [[File:FCGear_PlanetaryGear.svg|16px]] Planetary Gear Assembly}} option from the menu.
# The '''Planetary Gear Assembly''' [[Task_Panel|Task Panel]] opens.
# Adjust the parameters and press {{Button|OK}} To finish configuration and close the Task Panel
# An assembly, a PlanetaryGear object, is created.

==Properties==

See also: [[Property_View|Property View]].

An FCGear '''PlanetaryGear''' object is derived from an [[Assembly_CreateAssembly#Properties|Assembly::AssemblyObject]] object and inherits all its properties. It also has the following additional properties:

=== Data ===

{{Properties_Title|Part}}

* {{PropertyData|_Part_ShapeCache|ShapeCache}}:


An FCGear '''PlanetaryGear_Configuration''' object is derived from an [[App_FeaturePython#Properties|App::FeaturePython]] object and inherits all its properties. It also has the following additional properties:

=== Data ===

{{Properties_Title|accuracy}}

* {{PropertyData|numpoints|Integer}}: Number of points used per involute flank
* {{PropertyData|simple|Bool}}: Draw simplified cylinders instead of real teeth

{{TitleProperty|assembly}}

* {{PropertyData|assembly|Link}}: Assembly container
* {{PropertyData|carrier|Link}}: Planet carrier
* {{PropertyData|use_assembly|Bool}}: Insert gears into an Assembly container and ground the ring gear

{{TitleProperty|computed}}

* {{PropertyData|ratio_ring_fixed|Float}}: Ratio (carrier / sun) with ring fixed
* {{PropertyData|sun_planet_distance|Length}}: Sun-planet centre distance
* {{PropertyData|validation_message|String}}: Validation messages
* {{PropertyData|z_ring|Integer}}: Ring gear teeth

{{TitleProperty|fillets}}

* {{PropertyData|head_fillet|Float}}: Fillet radius at the tooth tip, as a fraction of the module
* {{PropertyData|root_fillet|Float}}: Fillet radius at the tooth root, as a fraction of the module

{{TitleProperty|gears}}

* {{PropertyData|planet_gears|LinkList}}: Planet gears
* {{PropertyData|ring_gear|Link}}: Ring gear
* {{PropertyData|sun_gear|Link}}: Sun gear

{{TitleProperty|helical}}

* {{PropertyData|double_helix|Bool}}: Make every gear a herringbone gear
* {{PropertyData|helix_angle|Angle}}: Helix angle of every gear

{{TitleProperty|hole}}

* {{PropertyData|hole_planets|Length}}: Bore diameter of the planet gears (0 for no bore)
* {{PropertyData|hole_sun|Length}}: Bore diameter of the sun gear (0 for no bore)

{{TitleProperty|kinematics}}

* {{PropertyData|carrier_angle|Angle}}: Carrier rotation angle

{{TitleProperty|parameters}}

* {{PropertyData|height|Length}}: Gear height
* {{PropertyData|module|Length}}: Module
* {{PropertyData|num_planets|Integer}}: Number of planet gears
* {{PropertyData|pressure_angle|Angle}}: Pressure angle
* {{PropertyData|ring_thickness|Length}}: Wall thickness of the ring gear rim
* {{PropertyData|shift_planet|Float}}: Planet profile shift
* {{PropertyData|shift_ring|Float}}: Ring profile shift
* {{PropertyData|shift_sun|Float}}: Sun profile shift
* {{PropertyData|z_planet|Integer}}: Planet gear teeth
* {{PropertyData|z_sun|Integer}}: Sun gear teeth

{{TitleProperty|tolerance}}

* {{PropertyData|backlash|Length}}: Backlash of every mesh
* {{PropertyData|clearance|Float}}: Clearance between tooth tip and root
* {{PropertyData|head|Float}}: Addendum factor of sun and planet gears
* {{PropertyData|head_ring|Float}}: Addendum factor of the ring gear

{{Properties_Title|version}}

* {{PropertyData|version|String}}: freecad.gears-version.


For '''RingGear''' object properties see [[FCGear_InternalInvoluteGear#Properties|Internal Involute Gear]], and for '''SunGear''' and '''PlanetGear''' object properties see [[FCGear_InvoluteGear#Properties|Involute Gear]].

==Notes==

This tool does not work properly with the Assembly version in xwzCAD 2.1-pre yet. Objects seem to build correct but the positioning fails.


